OL,3,GNEWSAWrestler Benjamin Satterley, known
OL,4,Aas Pac, dies aged 40
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish wrestler Benjamin Satterley,
OL,7,Fknown as Pac, has died, his
OL,8,Frepresentatives have confirmed.
OL,10,FAll Elite Wrestling (AEW) said it was
OL,11,F"saddened to announce the passing" of
OL,12,FSatterley, 40, who they said had signed
OL,13,Fwith them in 2019.
OL,15,FThe wrestler's death was confirmed just
OL,16,Fa day after he participated in AEW's
OL,17,F"All Out" event at an arena in Chicago
OL,18,Fon Saturday evening.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
