OL,3,GNEWSAWrestler Benjamin Satterley, known
OL,4,Aas Pac, dies aged 40
OL,5,
OL,6,F"A native of Newcastle upon Tyne,
OL,7,FEngland, Satterley began his wrestling
OL,8,Fcareer in 2004 and went on to perform
OL,9,Ffor wrestling organizations all over
OL,10,Fthe world, captivating fans with
OL,11,Finnovative high-flying moves and
OL,12,Fincredible in-ring ability," AEW said
OL,13,Fin a statement.
